O|
N|               The inner sanctum of another Commander. Unsettling to Offred.        
N|               She takes in the books and maps. Photos of him with his              
N|               fishing buddies. A few taxidermy birds and animals, hunting          
N|               trophies. Smart of that wolf to come around in deep winter,          
N|               when no one’s home, or he could be on the wall too.                  
O|
N|               Offred goes to the desk and opens drawers.                           
O|
N|               Then she sees a KEYCHAIN, holding both house keys and car            
N|               keys, in a lumpy clay BOWL on the desk. Success.                     
O|
N|               Her triumph fades when she picks up the bowl, registering            
N|               that it’s something a child made.                                    
N|               Something Hannah made.                                               
O|
