N|               Crayon drawings sit framed around the desk, along with               
N|               snapshots of Hannah and her adoptive PARENTS. Laughing,              
N|               picnicking, having fun by the lake.                                  
N|               Bittersweet, this all lands on Offred like a body blow.              
O|
N|               Because it means that Hannah is loved.                               
O|
N|               She left Hannah, and now someone else loves her.                     
